  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Twinning med Transportstyrelsen. Sidas st&#xf6;d inom detta beslut avser Transportstyrelsens kostnader f&#xf6;r det f&#xf6;rberedande projektet &quot;Improvement of Maritime Safety, Security and marine environment protection in the Republic of Azerbaijan &quot; AZ11/ENPPCA/TP/17. Total EU-budget f&#xf6;r Twinningen &#xe4;r 900 00 EUR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twinning with the Swedish Transport Agency. Sida&apos;s support within this decision regards the Swedish Transport Agency&apos;s costs for the preparatory project &quot;Improvement of Maritime Safety, Security and marine environment protection in the Republic of Azerbaijan &quot; AZ11/ENPPCA/TP/17&quot;. Total EU budget for the Twinning is 900 000 EUR.</narrative>
  </description>
